{"3195470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BARD'S FAULT", "steam_appid": 3195470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bard’s Fault takes the addictive loop of the Survivor genre and adds the one thing missing: <strong>Your Friends</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FELLOWSHIP ENGINE (Co-op)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Don't fight alone:</strong> Interact between characters to generate unique combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Synergy Matters:</strong> Each character brings abilities that shape the team’s composition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/b433f72f79dd3c99689d329ac570fcfa.poster.avif?t=1787690844\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/b433f72f79dd3c99689d329ac570fcfa.webm?t=1787690844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/b433f72f79dd3c99689d329ac570fcfa.mp4?t=1787690844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR SYMPHONY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Deep Theory-crafting:</strong> No two runs are alike. Choose  cards, Itens, and bonus skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Visual Clarity:</strong> Enjoy a vibrant, cozy art style designed to let you see the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/ec92aa433c2c18c5bf2729ea20063705.poster.avif?t=1787690844\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/ec92aa433c2c18c5bf2729ea20063705.webm?t=1787690844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/ec92aa433c2c18c5bf2729ea20063705.mp4?t=1787690844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TREE OF TIME (Meta-Progression)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Fail Forward:</strong> Dying is part of the plan. Your characters remember every loop, allowing you to return to the Tree of Time, upgrade your character, and investigate the cause of your own demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Uncover the Mystery:</strong> Why is the timeline broken? Unlock narrative threads that persist across runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/0891386d3fb9daba802a5234e237289a.poster.avif?t=1787690844\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/0891386d3fb9daba802a5234e237289a.webm?t=1787690844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/0891386d3fb9daba802a5234e237289a.mp4?t=1787690844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bard’s Fault takes the addictive loop of the Survivor genre and adds the one thing missing: <strong>Your Friends</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FELLOWSHIP ENGINE (Co-op)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Don't fight alone:</strong> Interact between characters to generate unique combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Synergy Matters:</strong> Each character brings abilities that shape the team’s composition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/b433f72f79dd3c99689d329ac570fcfa.poster.avif?t=1787690844\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/b433f72f79dd3c99689d329ac570fcfa.webm?t=1787690844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/b433f72f79dd3c99689d329ac570fcfa.mp4?t=1787690844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR SYMPHONY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Deep Theory-crafting:</strong> No two runs are alike. Choose  cards, Itens, and bonus skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Visual Clarity:</strong> Enjoy a vibrant, cozy art style designed to let you see the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/ec92aa433c2c18c5bf2729ea20063705.poster.avif?t=1787690844\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/ec92aa433c2c18c5bf2729ea20063705.webm?t=1787690844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/ec92aa433c2c18c5bf2729ea20063705.mp4?t=1787690844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TREE OF TIME (Meta-Progression)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Fail Forward:</strong> Dying is part of the plan. Your characters remember every loop, allowing you to return to the Tree of Time, upgrade your character, and investigate the cause of your own demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Uncover the Mystery:</strong> Why is the timeline broken? Unlock narrative threads that persist across runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/0891386d3fb9daba802a5234e237289a.poster.avif?t=1787690844\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/0891386d3fb9daba802a5234e237289a.webm?t=1787690844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/0891386d3fb9daba802a5234e237289a.mp4?t=1787690844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Bard’s Fault is a co-op Action Roguelike where you and your friends fight back-to-back against relentless swarms. Craft new builds, sync your abilities, and break the timeline in this multiplayer bullet heaven. Death is just the beginning, go back to the past and unravel a time-travel mystery.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/c9abca02a858a6988907984c98ece3c8f9f44277/header.jpg?t=1787690844", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/54e93fbdf86fdabd0e1398df86b7231a9dc197b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787690844", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/54e93fbdf86fdabd0e1398df86b7231a9dc197b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787690844", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86 2GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:<